# OPTIONAL. The app needs no .env file: `npm install && npm run dev` is enough.
#
# Only for a static deployment (without `vite dev` / `vite preview`), point the
# on-demand 20 m LOLA terrain of free coordinates at a CORS-enabled mirror of
# the NASA PGDA cloud-optimised GeoTIFF. Without it, free coordinates use the
# bundled 160 m terrain and the app says so; the candidate sites always use the
# bundled 20 m grids in public/dem/ and work fully offline.
#
# VITE_LOLA_COG_URL=https://example.org/path/to/LOLA_20mpp_south_pole.tif
